{
  "_what": "What a file's card says and in what order (src/workspace/file-card.ts, drawn by parts/ui/show/file-card). The card's actions are never listed here: they are the person's own Workshop tools whose screen marks an input as taking a file of this kind, and the screens that open on one (GET /work/api/workshop/for-file). Here: `lead` orders them (tool and screen ids first in this order, the rest in the order the Workshop lists them), `lead_count` how many are buttons before the ⋯ menu, `facts` the chips (FactChips fields: kind formats the value, chip.order places it), `fact_kinds` what kind each fact is to a rule, `suggestions` the next step offered when its `when` rule (a formula-engine rule tree over the fact row, decided by filterRowsByRules) holds and its action is one the card offers, `related` how many files from the same folder show, and `said` every word the card's frame says. Each part also asks the person's show rules (showOf, subject file-card), so any action, section or suggestion can be hidden or held by a rule. A new fact, suggestion or word is a row here.",
